  - m_Id: 37050177806344
    m_Localized: Menu
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 37050177806345
    m_Localized: How about that? Piece of cake!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 37050177806346
    m_Localized: 'Sign in with Apple

'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 37050177806347
    m_Localized: 'Sign in with Google

'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 37050177806348
    m_Localized: Start as Guest
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 37050177806349
    m_Localized: Try Again
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 37050177806350
    m_Localized: 'Analytics starts only if you agree to both options.

      You can play without selecting, and your choice is saved.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 37050177806351
    m_Localized: (Optional) I agree to the collection and use of game usage analytics
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 37050177806352
    m_Localized: (Optional) I agree to the transfer of analytics data overseas
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 37050177806353
    m_Localized: View Details
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 37050177806354
    m_Localized: 'The privacy policy describes how data is handled.

      Continuation of test progress and transfer to the official service is not guaranteed,

      and there is no grace period for recovery after account deletion.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 37050177806355
    m_Localized: Full Terms of Service
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 37050177806356
    m_Localized: Privacy Policy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 37050177806357
    m_Localized: I Agree
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 37050177806358
    m_Localized: Back
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 37050177806359
    m_Localized: Don't Agree
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 37050177806360
    m_Localized: 'Processor: GameAnalytics

      Items: analytics identifier, device/app/session/country info,

      battle result, wave, time, kills, skill damage, card choices

      Purpose: usage status and balance improvement

      Retention: raw/annotated 1 month / Player Warehouse 1 year /

      Player Lookup for retention 18 months'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 37050177806361
    m_Localized: 'Recipient: GameAnalytics ApS and affiliates (USA)

      Contact: privacy@gameanalytics.com

      Transfer: SDK network transmission during gameplay

      Items, purpose, retention: same as the analytics items above'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 37050177806362
    m_Localized: "Analytics starts only if you agree to both options.\nYou can play without selecting, and your choice is saved.\nYou can change it in Settings \u2192 Privacy Choices.\nUnity diagnostics are separate from this choice.\nStopping events is not the same as ending all SDK communication.\nFully quit and relaunch to apply a new choice."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 37050177806363
    m_Localized: Not Agreed
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
